{"id": "whisperx_build_secret_access_requires_build_sa_binding", "type": "decision", "fact": "HF_TOKEN access must be granted to the service account that actually runs Cloud Build", "recommendation": "In gemini_hybrid_06_infra_cleanup/iteration_01_a, WhisperX builds relied on Cloud Build availableSecrets to inject HF_TOKEN from Secret Manager. The critical binding is on the service account passed to `gcloud builds submit --service-account=...`, not just the default Cloud Build service agent. The setup script now grants secretAccessor to both the Cloud Build path and the GitHub Actions build service account so deploy-whisper can build reliably.", "confidence": "medium", "provenance": [{"source": "agent", "reference": "gemini_hybrid_06_infra_cleanup/iteration_01_a", "date": "2026-03-22"}], "tags": ["architecture-refactor"], "affectedFiles": [], "createdAt": "2026-03-22T00:00:00Z", "updatedAt": "2026-03-22T00:00:00Z"}
{"id": "evidence_repair_iterations_can_reuse_canonical_validation_logs", "type": "decision", "fact": "An evidence-repair sub-iteration can be approved without duplicating a passing validation log when the canonical log explicitly binds itself to the new iteration", "recommendation": "In gemini_hybrid_09_cloud_run_orchestrator_02_functions_cleanup/iteration_01_a, the review approved reuse of `iteration_01/test-output.txt` because its header explicitly recorded `iteration=iteration_01_a` and the refreshed results/adversarial artifacts consistently pointed back to it. Treat missing iteration-local copies as a traceability weakness to document, not an automatic retry trigger, when the canonical artifact is authoritative and all frozen criteria remain met.", "confidence": "medium", "provenance": [{"source": "agent", "reference": "gemini_hybrid_09_cloud_run_orchestrator_02_functions_cleanup/iteration_01_a", "date": "2026-03-26"}], "tags": ["architecture-refactor", "review", "artifacts"], "affectedFiles": [".agent_process/work/gemini_hybrid_09_cloud_run_orchestrator_02_functions_cleanup/iteration_01/test-output.txt", ".agent_process/work/gemini_hybrid_09_cloud_run_orchestrator_02_functions_cleanup/iteration_01_a/results.md", ".agent_process/work/gemini_hybrid_09_cloud_run_orchestrator_02_functions_cleanup/iteration_01_a/adversarial-review.md"], "createdAt": "2026-03-26T00:00:00Z", "updatedAt": "2026-03-26T00:00:00Z"}
